Hello,

<% case @reminder.level %>
<% when 1 %>
Our records show that the invoices below are overdue. This may be an oversight: if you have already paid them, please disregard this message.
<% when 2 %>
This is a second reminder. We have not received payment of the invoices below, despite our earlier reminder. Please settle them as soon as possible.
<% else %>
This is a formal notice. The invoices below remain unpaid despite our previous reminders. If we do not receive payment promptly, we will take further steps to recover the amounts due.
<% end %>

<% @items.each do |item| %>
- <%= item.invoice.invoice_number %>, due <%= Accounting::DatePresenter.new(item.invoice.due_date).format %> (<%= pluralize((@sent_on - item.invoice.due_date).to_i, "day") %> overdue): <%= Accounting::MoneyPresenter.new(item.amount_due).format %>
<% end %>

Total due: <%= Accounting::MoneyPresenter.new(@items.sum(&:amount_due)).format %>

The invoices are attached.

Kind regards,
<%= @entity.legal_name %>
